      "id": "claim_6aeff7747054485cb33b97c4113f7ded",
      "statement": "build_physics_rules returns ten manual transformations whose relations are hand-written sympy expressions set equal to zero over sp.symbols('v u a t s m F K W') — kinematics.v_u_at (v=u+at), kinematics.v2_u2_2as (v^2=u^2+2as), kinematics.s_ut_half_at2 (s=ut+1/2 at^2), kinematics.s_avg_v_t (s=(u+v)/2 t), kinematics.t_v_u_over_a (t=(v-u)/a), dynamics.F_ma, dynamics.a_F_over_m, dynamics.m_F_over_a, energy.KE_half_mv2 (K=1/2 mv^2), energy.W_Fs (W=Fs); each carries output_kind, input_kinds and solver_hook='sympy.algebra' so the engine can index rules by output kind.",
      "evidence": [
