      "statement": "parse_problem builds givens in three ordered layers with later sources never overwriting earlier ones: explicit overrides (strongest, force-entered before any regex), the 20-entry GIVEN_PATTERNS regex table over the unit vocabularies NUM/U_VEL/U_ACC/U_TIME/U_DIST/U_MASS/U_FORCE/U_ENERGY (first match fills a kind only if absent), and the IMPLICIT rules that encode rest to initial_velocity=0, comes to rest to final_velocity=0, and free fall/under gravity to acceleration=9.8; givens become unverified_truth facts via make_fact.",
